msgstr "舵机/电机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:100
#: 058bdbd3f9e644f8b41ded9ea9d8d695
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBeeF405 Mini supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M4 on the ESC connector, plus M5(LED) for LED strip or another "
"PWM output."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBeeF405 Mini 最多支持 5 路 PWM 输出。ESC 连接器上的 M1 至 M4 电机输出焊盘，以及 M5（LED）用于 LED"
" 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:102
#: 9b954882049e43e997a34b9b7643e97e
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:104
#: f60f8070612a4003b9fdfd8a0fd50232
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1–2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:105
#: 814072c3c283478bb6e616edeac7cf12
msgid "PWM 3-4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3–4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:106
#: f8288c262eba4b6ebb23da60a5a8db11
msgid "PWM 5 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:108
#: 85479779f7df47419d6cc09117605187
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1–4 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:112
#: 02e0d13106824effb26f3e8f5e782663
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:114
#: 6121dfe64e7e40b2bd37eb228a97b89e
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which can be used "
"for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except PPM/CRSF/ELRS and "
"SRXL2. CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 require the RX2 and TX2 pin be connected instead "
"of the SBUS pin."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚经反相器接入 RX2（UART2 RX），支持 ArduPilot 所有接收机协议，PPM/CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外。CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 需要连接 RX2 和 TX2 引脚，而非 SBUS 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:116
#: bbb2930765754df0a9d1036432c3daa8
msgid "SRXL2 requires :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:117
#: 8b12921fd8394cb38bb4a52fdfbb5ef6
msgid ""
"Fport should be connected to TX2 via a bi-directional inverter and "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"Fport 应通过双向反相器连接到 TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:119
#: b89e501098f34f4e944966bd6e1e3e47
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART "
"上需要外部反相器）。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:121
#: ec5f3b42c0a34f84a8138d2e90d92508
msgid ""
"the \"4V5\" pins are powered when USB is connected. Be careful not to "
"present too much load to the USB source or voltage droop may occur. All "
"other 5V pins are only powered when battery is present."
msgstr "「4V5」引脚在 USB 连接时供电。注意不要给 USB 电源过多负载，否则可能出现电压跌落。其他所有 5V 引脚仅在连接电池时供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:124
#: e6c50bd69dad4568973e89bb09f37af6
msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "蓝牙"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:126
#: 7b2c730358a14ce5b66447d2badda04f
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBeeF405-Mini has an integrated wireless module connected to UART4 "
"but its BLE Bluetooth is not compatible with exisiting ArduPilot ground "
"stations for Windows or Android."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBeeF405-Mini 集成了连接到 UART4 的无线模块，但其 BLE 蓝牙与现有适用于 Windows 或 Android 的 "
"ArduPilot 地面站不兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:129
#: ee109ec93332493098111a5a6e5fa7f2
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:131
#: b4156c34158a43a9908b2bb10f8796be
msgid ""
"The SpeedyBeeF405-Mini supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is "
"supported using UART1 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"SpeedyBeeF405-Mini 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用内部 OSD。外部 OSD 支持（如 DJI 或 "
"DisplayPort）可通过 UART1 或其他空闲 UART 实现。详情参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:134
#: 32a8ca083b50469f8d1860246b1ccbd0
