#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:152
#: cfbe080025c5451281ee164ad35a5064
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:154
#: 0bb2cbca328b41d58726b73818905d2f
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected as shown "
"below in order for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"此板不包含 GPS 或罗盘，因此应按下图连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-"
"page>`，以使自主模式正常运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:157
#: 3ea918dbfe0d45a6a684a24fed968e64
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:158
#: 70a50d35590544e988cc840eed98d321
msgid ""
"This board does not come with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed. Use "
"instructions here to load ArduPilot the first time :ref:`common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"此板未预装 ArduPilot 固件。请按此处说明首次加载 ArduPilot：:ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:160
#: 959ee948efe44d70b5930600223de440
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"SpeedyBeeF405Mini\". Only Copter firmware is pre-built since this "
"autopilot is very targeted for that application."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的子文件夹 「SpeedyBeeF405Mini」 "
"中找到。由于该飞控主要针对多旋翼应用，仅预构建 Copter 固件。"
